ys (like Ctrl & Command) that are handled at preprocessor level, this causes the problem described in #121578 issue, more detail over on that issue.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121578 \r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nTested these changes on Windows 11, which fixes the duplicate Ctrl modifier, but I can't confirm the same on MacOS with Command modifier as I don't have the necessary hardware to do so.\r\n\r\nAlso I haven't had the time to test on Linux, if prompted to test by the maintainers, then I've no problems testing on Linux as well (maybe this weekend).\r\n\r\n<details><summary><b>Screenshots</b></summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"429\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5315252e-d85b-4f85-a9ce-9b50c3731291\" />\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details> \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nAs I'm not knowledgeable enough in CS, idk if this's the most optimal solution in time/space complexity (even though it isn't called often, but still), if anyone have insight on this matter, then suggestions are welcomed 😄\r\n\r\n## Use of AI\r\nNo AI was used in the process of finding, debugging, and implementing a solution for the issue this PR tries to solve.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":